   100	Use **Request headers** for ordinary loopback development. To validate **Auto**
   101	against the local authorization server and database, use the complete tunneled
   102	OAuth workflow below.
   103	
   104	The client must run on the same machine to reach `127.0.0.1`. A cloud-hosted MCP
   105	client cannot connect to the local endpoint.
   106	
   107	### Complete local OAuth through Cloudflare Tunnel
   108	
   109	The loopback endpoint is sufficient for request-header credentials and automated
   110	tests. To exercise a real MCP client's OAuth discovery, browser consent, token
   111	exchange, and authenticated MCP call against the local database, route two stable
   112	HTTPS hostnames through one named Cloudflare Tunnel:
   113	
   114	```yaml
   115	tunnel: YOUR_TUNNEL_ID
   116	credentials-file: /absolute/path/to/YOUR_TUNNEL_ID.json
   117	ingress:
   118	  - hostname: app-local.skillplane.dev
   119	    service: http://127.0.0.1:5700
   120	  - hostname: mcp-local.skillplane.dev
   121	    service: http://127.0.0.1:5701
   122	  - service: http_status:404
   123	```
   124	
   125	After creating the tunnel and DNS routes, configure the exact OAuth identities:
   126	
   127	```bash
   128	pnpm db:up
   129	pnpm local:init
   130	pnpm local:oauth:configure -- \
   131	  --app-url https://app-local.skillplane.dev \
   132	  --mcp-url https://mcp-local.skillplane.dev
   133	```
   134	
   135	Start `pnpm dev:app:auth`, `pnpm dev:mcp`, and `pnpm local:tunnel` in separate
   136	terminals. Then run:
   137	
   138	```bash
   139	pnpm test:local:oauth
   140	```
   141	
   142	The verifier dynamically registers a loopback client, opens the browser for OTP
   143	sign-in and consent, exchanges the PKCE authorization code, connects to MCP with
   144	the resulting access token, calls `workspaces_list`, and revokes the token. The
   145	tunnel must not require a separate Cloudflare Access login because OAuth discovery
   146	and token endpoints must remain reachable by the MCP client.
   147	
   148	#### Codex
